Elektron
--------
Elektron and Analog Rytm are trademarks of Elektron Music Machines. This
project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Elektron. It contains no
Elektron firmware and publishes no firmware image: the .elemod files carry
our own bytes and the sha256 of the stock bytes they replace, plus a few
short stock fragments where a mod must repeat them (the stock instructions a
detour stub re-executes, and the 2-byte stock words of the core-0.2 guard
sites, which leave the image unchanged). Every image is built on the user's
machine from the stock OS file the user supplies. Never publish a built .syx: it contains Elektron's code.
